// Clubhouse docs: every changelog entry repeats Changed, Why and Verification under its own dated heading
// (docs/clubhouse/templates/CHANGELOG.md), so a repeated heading is only a defect between siblings.
// Line length is the repo's rule (../../.markdownlint.jsonc: prose only, tables and code are not counted).
{
  "extends": "../../.markdownlint.jsonc",
  "MD024": { "siblings_only": true }
}
